# Build artifacts from `newm2 build projects/macide/*.mod`.
# The compiled binary is written next to each source with NO file extension on
# macOS (e.g. macos_panes_ide, fmtcli), which *.exe/*.obj can't catch — so ignore
# everything here except sources, and the macOS bare-name binaries go away too.
*
!.gitignore
!*/
!*.mod
!*.def
!*.md
